From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tom <tompt@seznam.cz>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:40:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] iio: adc: add Apple Orion Bellatrix Lightning VBUS telemetry

Read the J120 Lightning VBUS ADC on demand. Serialize conversions, bound the wait and verify restoration of the control register before returning a measurement.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../iio/adc/apple,orion-bellatrix-vbus.yaml   |  26 +++
 drivers/iio/adc/Kconfig                       |  10 +
 drivers/iio/adc/Makefile                      |   1 +
 drivers/iio/adc/apple-orion-vbus.c            | 197 ++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 234 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/apple,orion-bellatrix-vbus.yaml
 create mode 100644 drivers/iio/adc/apple-orion-vbus.c

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/apple,orion-bellatrix-vbus.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/apple,orion-bellatrix-vbus.yaml
